D. THE FACTORIAL READOUT:  Lambda_k(J) = -L(z^2 Phi_k(z)),  L(z^n)=n!
==========================================================================
   k=2: direct == L-form  True
   k=3: direct == L-form  True
   k=4: direct == L-form  True
   k=5: direct == L-form  True
   k=6: direct == L-form  True
   k=7: direct == L-form  True
   k=8: direct == L-form  True
   L is the Edo-van den Essen factorial functional of the SFC lane
   (THM-2173/2812/2836).  The edge index k sets the binomial weight;
   the jet index j sets the factorial.  SHARED FUNCTIONAL, NOT a reduction:
   SFC evaluates L on f^m (NONLINEAR in the coefficients), the circuit
   evaluates L on an object LINEAR in the jets.  That is the loss.
  VERDICT D: IDENTITY VERIFIED k=2..8

